00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:14.730
The second is
increasing our speed

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:19.620
to market for the price
changes and enabling just a lot

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:24.300
more efficiencies for how
we're making those changes.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:27.190
Again, you go across
multiple systems.

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:29.040
It takes a lot of
time, takes a lot

00:14:29.040 --> 00:14:31.740
